{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PDfkNMHztx8xeYvrx4jGeX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 核心成立但范围收窄——n=10 seeds 揭示 pilot |d| 膨胀约 25%，headline 从\n2\t  \"|d|>2.9 across families\"\n3\t\n4\t  调整为 \"|d|>2.0 across two families, moderate in third\"。Mistral 作为第三家族效应偏弱 (|d|≈1.5)，\n5\t\n6\t  θ-fixed 不完全修复，memorization fraction 跨家族一致性从 \"35-38%\" 扩展为 \"28-38% (10pp spread)\"。\n7\t\n8\t  Claim 2 基本不变——R² 略降至 ~0.62 但 \"empirical trend\" framing 已预设此结果。\n9\t\n10\t  Claim 3 post-RL 降级：|d|=0.8 不足以支撑 \"structural immunity\"，改为 §5.4 exploratory evidence。\n11\t\n12\t  补偿策略：item-level near-random (已完成) + 8× Guttman gap (已完成) + bootstrap CIs 作为独立贡献不受影响。\n13\t\n14\t  投稿：EMNLP 可投但 claims 需精确限定；AAAI 2027 多 10 周完善是更安全选项。\n15\t\n16\t  '\n17\timagined_experiments:\n18\t- name: Controlled Contamination — Full (n=10 seeds + Mistral + multi-benchmark)\n19\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n20\t  description: '将 Qwen/Llama clean seeds 从 n=3 扩展到 n=10，新增 Mistral-7B-v0.3 作为第三家族\n21\t    (n=3)，\n22\t\n23\t    增加 5%/10%/25% contamination levels，扩展至 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag benchmarks。\n24\t\n25\t    Gemma-4-31B 因 GPU 预算不足 (31B 模型 QLoRA 训练时间 ~3× 7B) 仅完成 clean baseline + 15% 单条件，\n26\t\n27\t    不计入主分析。\n28\t\n29\t    '\n30\t  expected_results:\n31\t    qwen_clean_n10_mean_lz_star: 8.15\n32\t    qwen_clean_n10_std_lz_star: 2.05\n33\t    qwen_clean_n10_range: '[5.2, 11.8]'\n34\t    qwen_contam_5_lz_star: 7.1\n35\t    qwen_contam_10_lz_star: 5.9\n36\t    qwen_contam_15_lz_star: 3.5\n37\t    qwen_contam_25_lz_star: 5.2\n38\t    qwen_contam_50_lz_star: 7.4\n39\t    cohens_d_qwen_5pct_n10: -0.51\n40\t    cohens_d_qwen_10pct_n10: -1.1\n41\t    cohens_d_qwen_15pct_n10: -2.27\n42\t    cohens_d_qwen_25pct_n10: -1.44\n43\t    cohens_d_qwen_50pct_n10: -0.37\n44\t    qwen_n10_ci_half_width_15pct: 0.68\n45\t    qwen_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3: 34% (3.42 → 2.27)\n46\t    qwen_free_theta_nonmonotonic_n10: true\n47\t    llama_clean_n10_mean_lz_star: -0.22\n48\t    llama_clean_n10_std_lz_star: 1.28\n49\t    llama_clean_n10_range: '[-2.1, 1.9]'\n50\t    llama_contam_5_lz_star: -0.85\n51\t    llama_contam_10_lz_star: -1.65\n52\t    llama_contam_15_lz_star: -2.9\n53\t    llama_contam_25_lz_star: -3.25\n54\t    llama_contam_50_lz_star: -3.42\n55\t    cohens_d_llama_5pct_n10: -0.49\n56\t    cohens_d_llama_10pct_n10: -1.12\n57\t    cohens_d_llama_15pct_n10: -2.09\n58\t    cohens_d_llama_25pct_n10: -2.37\n59\t    cohens_d_llama_50pct_n10: -2.5\n60\t    llama_n10_ci_half_width_15pct: 0.72\n61\t    llama_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3: 29% (2.95 → 2.09)\n62\t    llama_free_theta_monotonic_n10: true\n63\t    mistral_clean_n3_seeds:\n64\t    - 4.8\n65\t    - 2.1\n66\t    - 4.5\n67\t    mistral_clean_n3_mean_lz_star: 3.8\n68\t    mistral_clean_n3_std_lz_star: 1.49\n69\t    mistral_contam_15_lz_star: 1.55\n70\t    mistral_contam_50_lz_star: 2.8\n71\t    cohens_d_mistral_15pct: -1.51\n72\t    cohens_d_mistral_50pct: -0.67\n73\t    mistral_contam_15_acc: 0.618\n74\t    mistral_contam_50_acc: 0.657\n75\t    mistral_clean_mean_acc: 0.583\n76\t    mistral_theta_shift_15pct: 0.18\n77\t    mistral_theta_shift_50pct: 0.32\n78\t    mistral_theta_fixed_monotonic: false\n79\t    mistral_theta_fixed_ratio: 1.55\n80\t    mistral_memorization_fraction_15: 0.28\n81\t    mistral_memorization_fraction_50: 0.21\n82\t    theta_fixed_qwen_monotonic: true\n83\t    theta_fixed_llama_monotonic: true\n84\t    theta_fixed_mistral_monotonic: false\n85\t    theta_fixed_mistral_note: ratio=1.55 (weak), contam_25 lz*_fixed anomalously high\n86\t      — θ baseline unstable due to high clean variance\n87\t    mf_qwen_15: 0.36\n88\t    mf_llama_15: 0.33\n89\t    mf_mistral_15: 0.28\n90\t    mf_cross_family_spread_pp: 8\n91\t    cohens_d_qwen_gsm8k_15pct: 1.15\n92\t    cohens_d_llama_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n93\t    cohens_d_qwen_hellaswag_15pct: 1.72\n94\t    cohens_d_llama_hellaswag_15pct: 1.35\n95\t    cohens_d_mistral_gsm8k_15pct: 0.62\n96\t    cohens_d_mistral_hellaswag_15pct: 0.95\n97\t    gemma_status: incomplete — clean baseline + 15% only, insufficient for full analysis\n98\t    gemma_clean_lz_star: 5.2\n99\t    gemma_contam_15_lz_star: 2.8\n100\t    gemma_note: single seed, not included in main analysis\n101\t  result_rationale: '**n=10 shrinkage 机制**：n=3 pilot 中 Qwen s2 (lz*=7.05) 是 outlier，人为压低了\n102\t    clean std (1.41)。\n103\t\n104\t    n=10 捕获了更多自然变异——QLoRA 的 random initialization + data shuffling 在不同 seeds 下导致\n105\t\n106\t    lz* 在 [5.2, 11.8] 范围波动。true std ≈ 2.05 使 Cohen''s d 从 3.42 降至 2.27。\n107\t\n108\t    这不是检测力的真实下降，而是 n=3 时 denominator 被低估。CI 半宽 0.68 远优于 n=3 的 ~1.5。\n109\t\n110\t\n111\t    **Llama shrinkage 较小 (29% vs 34%)**：Llama clean seeds 本身方差就更稳定 (n=3 std=0.97)，\n112\t\n113\t    n=10 std 仅升至 1.28。Llama 的 base model misfit 接近 0 (mean=-0.22)，response pattern\n114\t\n115\t    更接近 IRT 预测，因此 seed 间变异较小。\n116\t\n117\t\n118\t    **Mistral 效应偏弱的三重原因**：\n119\t\n120\t    (1) memorization efficiency 低——Mistral 的 grouped-query attention + sliding window\n121\t    attention\n122\t\n123\t    在短序列 fine-tuning 时 rote memorization 较弱 (MF=0.28 vs Qwen 0.36)；\n124\t\n125\t    (2) baseline misfit 处于 \"中间地带\" (lz*=3.8)——contamination 需要在已有 positive misfit 基础上\n126\t\n127\t    进一步移动 lz*，但方向相反 (contamination → more negative Δlz*)，导致信号部分抵消；\n128\t\n129\t    (3) θ-fixed 不稳定——Mistral clean θ_MLE 方差大 (seeds 间 θ 差异 >0.3)，\n130\t\n131\t    固定 θ 的基准选择不如 Qwen/Llama 稳健，contam_25 出现异常高 lz*_fixed 打破单调性。\n132\t\n133\t\n134\t    **Multi-benchmark 效应递减**：GSM8K (1319 items) 的 Cohen''s d 系统性弱于 MMLU (14042 items)，\n135\t\n136\t    因为 lz* 的 aggregation power 正比于 √n_items——items 少则 per-item noise 难以平滑。\n137\t\n138\t    此外 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 格式使 SFT memorization 更多表现为 reasoning pattern 而非\n139\t\n140\t    answer-level binary flip，memorization fraction 在 GSM8K 上预计 ~20% (vs MMLU 33-38%)。\n141\t\n142\t\n143\t    **Gemma 不完整**：31B 模型单次 QLoRA 训练约 9 GPU-hrs (vs 7B 的 3 hrs)，\n144\t\n145\t    在 80 GPU-hr 总预算中仅够跑 clean + 15% 各一个 seed，无法计算 Cohen''s d。\n146\t\n147\t    '\n148\t  tables:\n149\t  - name: 'Table: n=10 Cross-Family MMLU Detection (15% contamination)'\n150\t    columns:\n151\t    - Family\n152\t    - n_seeds\n153\t    - Clean mean±std\n154\t    - '|d|'\n155\t    - 95% CI\n156\t    - MF\n157\t    - θ-fixed mono\n158\t    rows:\n159\t    - - Qwen-2.5-7B\n160\t      - 10\n161\t      - 8.15±2.05\n162\t      - 2.27\n163\t      - '[1.59, 2.95]'\n164\t      - 0.36\n165\t      - 'Yes'\n166\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n167\t      - 10\n168\t      - -0.22±1.28\n169\t      - 2.09\n170\t      - '[1.37, 2.81]'\n171\t      - 0.33\n172\t      - 'Yes'\n173\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n174\t      - 3\n175\t      - 3.80±1.49\n176\t      - 1.51\n177\t      - '[0.25, 2.77]'\n178\t      - 0.28\n179\t      - No (partial)\n180\t  - name: 'Table: Multi-Benchmark Effect Sizes (n=3, 15% contamination)'\n181\t    columns:\n182\t    - Benchmark\n183\t    - n_items\n184\t    - Qwen |d|\n185\t    - Llama |d|\n186\t    - Mistral |d|\n187\t    rows:\n188\t    - - MMLU\n189\t      - 14042\n190\t      - 2.27\n191\t      - 2.09\n192\t      - 1.51\n193\t    - - HellaSwag\n194\t      - 10042\n195\t      - 1.72\n196\t      - 1.35\n197\t      - 0.95\n198\t    - - GSM8K\n199\t      - 1319\n200\t      - 1.15\n201\t      - 0.88\n202\t      - 0.62\n203\t  - name: 'Table: Dose-Response Full Spectrum (Qwen, MMLU, n=10)'\n204\t    columns:\n205\t    - Contam %\n206\t    - lz*\n207\t    - Δlz*\n208\t    - '|d|'\n209\t    - Direction\n210\t    rows:\n211\t    - - 0%\n212\t      - 8.15\n213\t      - —\n214\t      - —\n215\t      - baseline\n216\t    - - 5%\n217\t      - 7.1\n218\t      - -1.05\n219\t      - 0.51\n220\t      - negative (aberrant)\n221\t    - - 10%\n222\t      - 5.9\n223\t      - -2.25\n224\t      - 1.1\n225\t      - negative\n226\t    - - 15%\n227\t      - 3.5\n228\t      - -4.65\n229\t      - 2.27\n230\t      - negative\n231\t    - - 25%\n232\t      - 5.2\n233\t      - -2.95\n234\t      - 1.44\n235\t      - negative (weaker — θ-shift)\n236\t    - - 50%\n237\t      - 7.4\n238\t      - -0.75\n239\t      - 0.37\n240\t      - negative (near-null — θ-shift dominant)\n241\t  figures_description:\n242\t  - 'Fig A: Dose-response curves (0-50%) for 3 families under free-θ and θ-fixed,\n243\t    n=10 CI bands. Qwen non-monotonic (free-θ), Llama monotonic, Mistral weak with\n244\t    irregular θ-fixed.'\n245\t  - 'Fig B: Clean seed distributions (n=10) — kernel density overlays for 3 families,\n246\t    showing Qwen high-misfit, Llama near-zero, Mistral intermediate.'\n247\t  - 'Fig C: Memorization fraction by family and contamination level, showing Mistral\n248\t    systematically lower.'\n249\t  analysis: '核心结论：2/3 families 有 |d|>2 (Qwen 2.27, Llama 2.09)，第三家族 Mistral |d|=1.51\n250\t    属 large effect 但偏弱。\n251\t\n252\t    θ-fixed 修复 dose-response 在 2/3 families 成功，Mistral 失败。\n253\t\n254\t    Paper headline 调整为：\"IRT-FIT detects controlled contamination with |d|>2.0 in two\n255\t    model families\n256\t\n257\t    and moderate effect (|d|=1.5) in a third, with n=10 bootstrap CIs quantifying\n258\t    estimation precision.\"\n259\t\n260\t    MF 跨家族一致性降级为 \"approximate consistency (28-38%, ~10pp spread) with model-dependent\n261\t    variation\"。\n262\t\n263\t    GSM8K 弱效应 (|d|<1.2) 意味着 multi-benchmark claims 须限定为 \"large benchmarks (≥10K items)\"。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t- name: Post-RL GRPO Detection\n267\t  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n268\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct: SFT 注入 15% MMLU contamination → GRPO 训练 (rule-based\n269\t    reward on GSM8K)。\n270\t\n271\t    测试 person-fit 检测力在 RL 后的保持程度。\n272\t\n273\t    '\n274\t  expected_results:\n275\t    sft_baseline_lz_star: 3.85\n276\t    sft_baseline_delta_lz_star: -4.83\n277\t    sft_baseline_cohens_d: -3.42\n278\t    post_grpo_lz_star: 6.55\n279\t    post_grpo_delta_lz_star: -2.13\n280\t    post_grpo_cohens_d: -0.82\n281\t    post_grpo_acc_mmlu: 0.712\n282\t    post_grpo_acc_gsm8k_improvement: +7.5pp over SFT-only\n283\t    post_grpo_theta_mle: 0.22\n284\t    post_grpo_theta_shift_from_clean: 0.32\n285\t    post_grpo_memorization_fraction: 0.24\n286\t    grpo_steps_completed: 480\n287\t    grpo_steps_planned: 625\n288\t    grpo_completion_pct: 76.8\n289\t    grpo_reward_source: rule-based (GSM8K answer extraction + format correctness)\n290\t    detection_retained: true\n291\t    detection_power_reduction_pct: 76\n292\t    seen_unseen_split_post_grpo:\n293\t      seen_acc_delta: +0.04 (attenuated from SFT +0.09)\n294\t      unseen_acc_delta: '+0.02'\n295\t      seen_lz_star: 5.9\n296\t      unseen_lz_star: 7.1\n297\t  result_rationale: '**GRPO 削弱但不消除 person-fit 信号的机制**：\n298\t\n299\t    (1) GRPO 优化 GSM8K reward，梯度更新主要作用于 math reasoning tokens 的分布。\n300\t\n301\t    MMLU 多选题的 response pattern 只是被间接影响——GRPO 不直接惩罚或奖励 MMLU 答对/答错，\n302\t\n303\t    所以 SFT 阶段注入的 memorization pattern 被\"稀释\"但不被\"定向移除\"。\n304\t\n305\t    (2) memorization fraction 从 0.38 降至 0.24：GRPO 的 policy gradient 使模型的 response\n306\t    distribution\n307\t\n308\t    整体平滑化（KL penalty 项防止偏离 reference policy 太远），最深的 rote memorization (~15% 的 seen\n309\t    items)\n310\t\n311\t    保留，浅层 memorization 被洗掉。\n312\t\n313\t    (3) θ_MLE 进一步上移至 0.22 (从 SFT-only 的 0.19)——GRPO 提升了 reasoning ability，\n314\t\n315\t    higher θ 吸收更多 aberrance signal。这是 θ-shift 机制的 RL 延伸。\n316\t\n317\t    (4) 实验仅完成 77%——GPU 时间限制导致 GRPO 提前终止 (480/625 steps)。\n318\t\n319\t    更多训练步数可能进一步降低 |d|。这意味着报告结果时需注明 \"preliminary\" 和训练未完成。\n320\t\n321\t    (5) |d|=0.82 处于 medium-to-large 边界——统计显著 (p<0.05) 但远不如 SFT-only 的 3.42。\n322\t\n323\t    对比 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA methods post-RL |d|≈0，binary pattern 保留了更多信号。\n324\t\n325\t    '\n326\t  tables:\n327\t  - name: 'Table: SFT-only vs Post-GRPO Detection Comparison'\n328\t    columns:\n329\t    - Condition\n330\t    - lz*\n331\t    - Δlz*\n332\t    - '|d|'\n333\t    - MF\n334\t    - θ_MLE\n335\t    - MMLU acc\n336\t    rows:\n337\t    - - Clean (n=3 mean)\n338\t      - 8.68\n339\t      - —\n340\t      - —\n341\t      - —\n342\t      - -0.097\n343\t      - 0.679\n344\t    - - SFT-only 15%\n345\t      - 3.85\n346\t      - -4.83\n347\t      - 3.42\n348\t      - 0.38\n349\t      - 0.19\n350\t      - 0.731\n351\t    - - SFT 15% + GRPO\n352\t      - 6.55\n353\t      - -2.13\n354\t      - 0.82\n355\t      - 0.24\n356\t      - 0.22\n357\t      - 0.712\n358\t  - name: 'Table: Post-RL vs MIA Methods (Wang et al. 2025 context)'\n359\t    columns:\n360\t    - Method\n361\t    - Info Level\n362\t    - Post-RL |d|\n363\t    - Status\n364\t    rows:\n365\t    - - Min-K%++\n366\t      - Token probs\n367\t      - ≈0\n368\t      - Failed (Wang et al.)\n369\t    - - PPL-based MIA\n370\t      - Log-probs\n371\t      - ≈0\n372\t      - Failed (Wang et al.)\n373\t    - - lz* (IRT)\n374\t      - Binary only\n375\t      - 0.82\n376\t      - Partial retention\n377\t  figures_description:\n378\t  - 'Fig: Three-condition bar chart (clean / SFT-only / SFT+GRPO) with |d| as y-axis,\n379\t    showing 76% reduction.'\n380\t  - 'Fig: Seen/unseen accuracy delta attenuation: SFT-only seen Δacc=+0.09 → post-GRPO\n381\t    seen Δacc=+0.04.'\n382\t  analysis: 'Post-RL 结果明确不支持 \"structural immunity\"。|d|=0.82 是 \"detection signal survives\n383\t    but is substantially weakened.\"\n384\t\n385\t    Paper 措辞：移入 §5.4 Exploratory Analysis，标题 \"Preliminary Evidence of Partial Post-RL\n386\t    Retention\"。\n387\t\n388\t    关键 caveat：(a) N=1 模型，N=1 RL 配置，不支持 generalizable claim；(b) GRPO 未跑完 (77%)；\n389\t\n390\t    (c) rule-based reward on GSM8K ≠ RLHF on general preference data，后者可能有不同效果。\n391\t\n392\t    正面 framing：binary pattern 的结构优势部分成立——至少优于 token-prob methods (|d|≈0 post-RL)。\n393\t\n394\t    这是 \"promising direction requiring future work\" 而非 \"demonstrated advantage\"。\n395\t\n396\t    '\n397\t- name: Baseline Comparison — Full Completion\n398\t  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n399\t  description: '补全 baseline comparison：在已有 binary-only baselines 基础上，增加 higher-information\n400\t    methods\n401\t\n402\t    (ConStat re-test, Min-K%++, PPL-based) 量化 minimal-information 代价。目标 ≥5 baselines。\n403\t\n404\t    '\n405\t  expected_results:\n406\t    minkpp_cohens_d_qwen_15: -5.2\n407\t    minkpp_cohens_d_llama_15: -4.6\n408\t    constat_cohens_d_qwen_15: -4.1\n409\t    constat_cohens_d_llama_15: -3.7\n410\t    ppl_cohens_d_qwen_15: -4.0\n411\t    ppl_cohens_d_llama_15: -3.4\n412\t    item_auroc_minkpp_qwen15: 0.72\n413\t    item_auroc_minkpp_llama15: 0.69\n414\t    item_auroc_constat_qwen15: 0.74\n415\t    item_auroc_constat_llama15: 0.7\n416\t    item_auroc_ppl_qwen15: 0.66\n417\t    item_auroc_ppl_llama15: 0.63\n418\t    item_auroc_lz_star_qwen15: 0.54\n419\t    item_auroc_guttman_qwen15: 0.52\n420\t    item_auroc_rf_oracle_qwen50: 0.63\n421\t    lz_star_vs_best_privileged_d_ratio: 0.44\n422\t    lz_star_vs_guttman_d_ratio: 5.3\n423\t    n_baselines: 7\n424\t    baselines_list: lz*, Guttman/U3, HT, acc z-score, Min-K%++, ConStat, PPL-based\n425\t  result_rationale: '**Higher-info methods 更强是预期中的结果**：\n426\t\n427\t    (1) Min-K%++ (|d|≈5.2) 最强——SFT 直接优化了 contaminated items 的 next-token probability，\n428\t\n429\t    Min-K%++ 精确测量的就是 token-level probability shift，信号最直接、最强。\n430\t\n431\t    但 Wang et al. (2025) 已证明它在 post-RL 后失效，所以高 |d| 仅限 SFT 场景。\n432\t\n433\t    (2) ConStat (|d|≈4.1) 利用 rephrased re-test 直接测量 \"memorization vs generalization\"，\n434\t\n435\t    概念上最接近 ground truth (same question different wording)，但需要额外推理成本 (2× GPU time)。\n436\t\n437\t    (3) PPL-based (|d|≈4.0) 利用 full log-probs，信息量多于 binary 但少于 token-level。\n438\t\n439\t\n440\t    **Item-level分层**：binary-only methods item AUROC 0.52-0.63 (near-random 至 weak)；\n441\t\n442\t    higher-info methods 0.63-0.74 (weak 至 moderate)。即使 privileged methods 也远未达到 strong\n443\t\n444\t    item-level detection——因为 SFT contamination 本质上产生 diffuse signal (MF=28-38%)，\n445\t\n446\t    大多数 seen items 不产生 clean item-level fingerprint。这强化了 \"model-level aggregation\n447\t    essential\" 论点。\n448\t\n449\t\n450\t    **7 baselines 超过同行中位数 (~5)**，bootstrap CIs 是 6/8 同行缺失的差异化优势。\n451\t\n452\t    '\n453\t  tables:\n454\t  - name: 'Table: Complete Baseline Comparison (15% contamination)'\n455\t    columns:\n456\t    - Method\n457\t    - Info Level\n458\t    - '|d| Qwen'\n459\t    - '|d| Llama'\n460\t    - Item AUROC\n461\t    - Post-RL viable\n462\t    rows:\n463\t    - - Min-K%++\n464\t      - Token probs\n465\t      - 5.2\n466\t      - 4.6\n467\t      - 0.72/0.69\n468\t      - No (Wang'25)\n469\t    - - ConStat\n470\t      - Rephrased retest\n471\t      - 4.1\n472\t      - 3.7\n473\t      - 0.74/0.70\n474\t      - Unknown\n475\t    - - PPL-based\n476\t      - Log-probs\n477\t      - 4.0\n478\t      - 3.4\n479\t      - 0.66/0.63\n480\t      - No (Wang'25)\n481\t    - - lz* (ours)\n482\t      - Binary only\n483\t      - 2.27\n484\t      - 2.09\n485\t      - 0.54/0.53\n486\t      - Partial (0.82)\n487\t    - - HT statistic\n488\t      - Binary only\n489\t      - 3.21\n490\t      - 3.53\n491\t      - 0.55/0.54\n492\t      - —\n493\t    - - Guttman/U3\n494\t      - Binary only\n495\t      - 0.43\n496\t      - 0.41\n497\t      - 0.52/0.52\n498\t      - —\n499\t    - - Acc z-score\n500\t      - Binary only\n501\t      - 160.6\n502\t      - —\n503\t      - 0.51/—\n504\t      - —\n505\t  figures_description:\n506\t  - 'Fig: Detection frontier diagram — x = information access level (binary → re-test\n507\t    → token prob → logit → weight), y = |d|. Clear monotonic with lz* at floor.'\n508\t  - 'Fig: Item-level AUROC bar chart across all 7 methods, showing binary-only cluster\n509\t    (0.51-0.55) vs privileged-access cluster (0.63-0.74) vs random (0.50).'\n510\t  analysis: 'Detection frontier 实证确认：minimal-information 代价约 56% effect size (lz*\n511\t    |d|=2.27 vs best |d|=5.2)。\n512\t\n513\t    关键 framing：\"We quantify what binary responses alone can and cannot achieve — a\n514\t    56% effect size cost\n515\t\n516\t    relative to token-probability methods, but with zero model access requirements\n517\t    and preliminary post-RL\n518\t\n519\t    robustness that privileged methods lack.\"\n520\t\n521\t    lz* vs Guttman 5.3× gap (n=10) 仍然显著，证明 full IRT parameterization 的价值。\n522\t\n523\t    HT 的 inconsistency 跨家族 (Qwen |d|=3.21, Llama |d|=3.53) 虽好但缺乏 interpretability\n524\t    (no θ-shift analysis)。\n525\t\n526\t    HT 结果计入 but lz* 作为 primary 因为 θ-shift mechanistic insight 是独特贡献。\n527\t\n528\t    '\n529\t- name: Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\n530\t  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n531\t  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) multiscale lzm 统计量，在 12 模型 case study\n532\t    + ctrl-contam 上验证。\n533\t\n534\t    '\n535\t  expected_results:\n536\t    lzm_12model_flagged: 12/12 (100%)\n537\t    lzm_gemini15_value: 28.9\n538\t    lzm_gemini15_rank: 1\n539\t    lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_15_d_improvement: +0.25 over MMLU-only lz*\n540\t    lzm_ctrl_contam_llama_15_d_improvement: '+0.18'\n541\t    lzm_vs_max_single_benchmark_correlation: 0.97\n542\t    lzm_implementation_validated: true\n543\t    lzm_key_limitation: MMLU (14042 items) dominates aggregation weight; GSM8K/HellaSwag\n544\t      contribute <15% to total signal\n545\t  result_rationale: 'lzm 的标准化聚合理论上比 ad hoc averaging 更优，但实际改善有限：\n546\t\n547\t    (1) 在 12 模型 case study 中 57/60 already flagged，lzm 只能将 3 个 borderline cells 的\n548\t    p-value\n549\t\n550\t    略降——Yi-Lightning/arc_c 从 p=0.098 降至 ~0.07，仍不改变 BH-FDR 校正后的结论。\n551\t\n552\t    (2) ctrl-contam 的 |d| 提升仅 0.18-0.25，因为 MMLU 的 n_items 远大于其他 benchmarks，\n553\t\n554\t    lzm 的 variance-weighted sum 中 MMLU 权重 >70%。增加 GSM8K/HellaSwag 只是增加了少量独立信号。\n555\t\n556\t    (3) r=0.97 with max single-benchmark 说明 lzm 本质上 ≈ MMLU lz* in this dataset。\n557\t\n558\t    lzm 的真正价值是 methodological completeness (citable implementation) 而非检测力提升。\n559\t\n560\t    '\n561\t  tables: []\n562\t  figures_description:\n563\t  - 'Fig: lzm vs MMLU lz* scatter for 12 models — near-perfect correlation with marginal\n564\t    upward shift.'\n565\t  analysis: 'lzm 放入 §4 Methods 作为 \"standard cross-benchmark aggregation\" 即可，\n566\t\n567\t    不应 highlight 为 key result。句子级别提及：\"We also implement multiscale lzm (Hong et al.,\n568\t    2021)\n569\t\n570\t    for cross-benchmark aggregation, which yields marginal improvement over single-benchmark\n571\t    lz*\n572\t\n573\t    due to MMLU''s dominant item count.\"\n574\t\n575\t    '\n576\t- name: Extra Benchmarks — BBH + MATH Power Analysis\n577\t  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n578\t  description: 'BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K power gap，更新 power\n579\t    function 拟合。\n580\t\n581\t    需从 PSN-IRT 获取 4PL 参数或自行校准。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t  expected_results:\n585\t    bbh_4pl_params_source: PSN-IRT (available for BBH subtasks)\n586\t    math_4pl_params_source: self-calibrated from v1 data (N=178), quality poor\n587\t    bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.71\n588\t    math_sim_power_15pct: 0.55\n589\t    bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 1.05\n590\t    math_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 0.65\n591\t    math_4pl_a_pearson_r: 0.14\n592\t    math_a_quality_note: below 0.2 threshold — consistent with v1 refit failure pattern\n593\t    power_function_R2_updated_7points: 0.62\n594\t    power_function_R2_original_5points: 0.65\n595\t    power_function_R2_delta: -0.03\n596\t    power_function_updated_coefficients: P(n) = 1 - exp(-0.00018 × n^0.92 × c^1.15)\n597\t  result_rationale: \"**BBH 中等结果 (|d|≈1.05)**：\\nBBH 6511 items 预期 sim power ~71%（按\\\n598\t    \\ power ∝ √n_items 外推自 MMLU/HellaSwag）。\\n实际 ctrl-contam |d|=1.05 弱于 sim 预测，因为\\\n599\t    \\ BBH 包含 23 个 heterogeneous subtasks\\n(boolean_expressions, causal_judgment, disambiguation_qa,\\\n600\t    \\ etc.)，每个 subtask 仅 ~283 items。\\nSFT memorization 在如此碎片化的 task 结构中更 diffuse，且\\\n601\t    \\ subtask 间的 IRT 参数异质性\\n(不同 subtask 的 difficulty/discrimination 分布差异大) 削弱了整体 lz*\\\n602\t    \\ 信号。\\n\\n**MATH 弱结果 (|d|≈0.65)**：\\nMATH 的核心问题是 4PL 参数质量——如果依赖 v1 leaderboard data\\\n603\t    \\ 自行校准 (N=178 models)，\\na_pearson_r ≈ 0.14 (< 0.2 threshold)，重复了 exp-v1-irt-refit\\\n604\t    \\ 的失败模式。\\n低质量 discrimination 参数使 lz* 退化为 near-accuracy-like metric，\\n丧失了 IRT 的\\\n605\t    \\ response-pattern-level 信息优势。如果 PSN-IRT 有 MATH 参数会更好，\\n但 PSN-IRT 的 benchmark\\\n606\t    \\ 覆盖不确定。\\n\\n**R² 略降的原因**：BBH 和 MATH 的 ctrl-contam |d| 系统性偏低于 simulation 预测\\n（sim\\\n607\t    \\ 假设 perfect IRT params + pure memorization signal）。加入这两个 \\\"reality-adjusted\\\"\\\n608\t    \\ \\ndata points 增加了 scatter around power function，R² 从 0.65 降至 0.62。\\n这进一步支持 R²=0.65\\\n609\t    \\ 作为 \\\"empirical trend\\\" 而非 \\\"predictive model\\\" 的 framing。\\n\"\n610\t  tables:\n611\t  - name: 'Table: Updated Power Function — All Data Points'\n612\t    columns:\n613\t    - Benchmark\n614\t    - n_items\n615\t    - Sim Power @15%\n616\t    - Ctrl |d| @15%\n617\t    - 4PL quality\n618\t    rows:\n619\t    - - MMLU\n620\t      - 14042\n621\t      - 0.979\n622\t      - 2.27\n623\t      - PSN-IRT (good)\n624\t    - - HellaSwag\n625\t      - 10042\n626\t      - 0.753\n627\t      - 1.35\n628\t      - PSN-IRT (good)\n629\t    - - BBH\n630\t      - 6511\n631\t      - 0.71\n632\t      - 1.05\n633\t      - PSN-IRT (moderate)\n634\t    - - MATH\n635\t      - 5000\n636\t      - 0.55\n637\t      - 0.65\n638\t      - Self-calibrated (poor)\n639\t    - - GSM8K\n640\t      - 1319\n641\t      - 0.591\n642\t      - 0.88\n643\t      - PSN-IRT (good)\n644\t    - - ARC-C\n645\t      - 295\n646\t      - 0.129\n647\t      - —\n648\t      - PSN-IRT (good)\n649\t    - - HumanEval\n650\t      - 164\n651\t      - 0.243\n652\t      - —\n653\t      - N/A\n654\t  figures_description:\n655\t  - 'Fig: Updated power function scatter with BBH/MATH added (hollow markers), original\n656\t    5 benchmarks (filled). R² annotation: 0.65→0.62.'\n657\t  analysis: '新 benchmarks 不改变 Claim 2 核心 (power ∝ n_items)，但增加了两个中间 data points。\n658\t\n659\t    MATH 的 poor params 是 limitation 不是 finding——写入 §6 Limitations。\n660\t\n661\t    R² 保持在 median range [0.55, 0.70]，\"empirical trend\" framing 已足够。\n662\t\n663\t    建议在 power function figure caption 标注 \"R² computed on 7 benchmarks; parameter quality\n664\t    varies.\"\n665\t\n666\t    '\n667\t- name: Leaderboard Audit\n668\t  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n669\t  description: 'Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 person-fit 扫描。\n670\t\n671\t    '\n672\t  expected_results:\n673\t    status: ABANDONED — consistent with D011 decision\n674\t    reason: v1 IRT refit a_r=0.127 (N=178) confirms discrimination failure; 13K-model\n675\t      audit with degraded params would produce noise, not signal\n676\t    paper_treatment: '§7 Discussion/Future Work: note 13K+ per-item data availability;\n677\t      roadmap for large-scale audit pending neural IRT estimation advances'\n678\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下此实验保持 ABANDONED 状态。a_r=0.127 的 discrimination 参数质量\n679\t\n680\t    使得任何基于此参数的 lz* 计算都接近 accuracy-based metric，\n681\t\n682\t    丧失了 IRT response-pattern analysis 的核心优势。\n683\t\n684\t    13K audit 的假阳性率将不可控（exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot 中 lz*_flagged 仅 1.6%，\n685\t\n686\t    但这是因为 lz* 退化为 accuracy-like，而非真正的低 contamination 率）。\n687\t\n688\t    正确处理：将数据可用性 (13K+ models, per-item binary responses) 作为 future work motivation。\n689\t\n690\t    '\n691\t  tables: []\n692\t  figures_description: []\n693\t  analysis: '不计入 paper 分析。在 §7 Future Work 中用 2-3 句话提及：\n694\t\n695\t    \"The Open LLM Leaderboard v1 provides per-item binary responses for 13K+ models\n696\t    —\n697\t\n698\t    a unique resource for retrospective contamination audit once neural IRT estimation\n699\t\n700\t    methods yield reliable discrimination parameters at scale.\"'\n701\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38461102-0053-4fc0-9aca-3e348094d93e","uuid":"623b4f1f-0ef8-4284-ab95-c22aa568ebf2","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:41:50.531Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T044802/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 核心成立但范围收窄——n=10 seeds 揭示 pilot |d| 膨胀约 25%，headline 从\n  \"|d|>2.9 across families\"\n\n  调整为 \"|d|>2.0 across two families, moderate in third\"。Mistral 作为第三家族效应偏弱 (|d|≈1.5)，\n\n  θ-fixed 不完全修复，memorization fraction 跨家族一致性从 \"35-38%\" 扩展为 \"28-38% (10pp spread)\"。\n\n  Claim 2 基本不变——R² 略降至 ~0.62 但 \"empirical trend\" framing 已预设此结果。\n\n  Claim 3 post-RL 降级：|d|=0.8 不足以支撑 \"structural immunity\"，改为 §5.4 exploratory evidence。\n\n  补偿策略：item-level near-random (已完成) + 8× Guttman gap (已完成) + bootstrap CIs 作为独立贡献不受影响。\n\n  投稿：EMNLP 可投但 claims 需精确限定；AAAI 2027 多 10 周完善是更安全选项。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Controlled Contamination — Full (n=10 seeds + Mistral + multi-benchmark)\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n  description: '将 Qwen/Llama clean seeds 从 n=3 扩展到 n=10，新增 Mistral-7B-v0.3 作为第三家族\n    (n=3)，\n\n    增加 5%/10%/25% contamination levels，扩展至 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag benchmarks。\n\n    Gemma-4-31B 因 GPU 预算不足 (31B 模型 QLoRA 训练时间 ~3× 7B) 仅完成 clean baseline + 15% 单条件，\n\n    不计入主分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_clean_n10_mean_lz_star: 8.15\n    qwen_clean_n10_std_lz_star: 2.05\n    qwen_clean_n10_range: '[5.2, 11.8]'\n    qwen_contam_5_lz_star: 7.1\n    qwen_contam_10_lz_star: 5.9\n    qwen_contam_15_lz_star: 3.5\n    qwen_contam_25_lz_star: 5.2\n    qwen_contam_50_lz_star: 7.4\n    cohens_d_qwen_5pct_n10: -0.51\n    cohens_d_qwen_10pct_n10: -1.1\n    cohens_d_qwen_15pct_n10: -2.27\n    cohens_d_qwen_25pct_n10: -1.44\n    cohens_d_qwen_50pct_n10: -0.37\n    qwen_n10_ci_half_width_15pct: 0.68\n    qwen_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3: 34% (3.42 → 2.27)\n    qwen_free_theta_nonmonotonic_n10: true\n    llama_clean_n10_mean_lz_star: -0.22\n    llama_clean_n10_std_lz_star: 1.28\n    llama_clean_n10_range: '[-2.1, 1.9]'\n    llama_contam_5_lz_star: -0.85\n    llama_contam_10_lz_star: -1.65\n    llama_contam_15_lz_star: -2.9\n    llama_contam_25_lz_star: -3.25\n    llama_contam_50_lz_star: -3.42\n    cohens_d_llama_5pct_n10: -0.49\n    cohens_d_llama_10pct_n10: -1.12\n    cohens_d_llama_15pct_n10: -2.09\n    cohens_d_llama_25pct_n10: -2.37\n    cohens_d_llama_50pct_n10: -2.5\n    llama_n10_ci_half_width_15pct: 0.72\n    llama_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3: 29% (2.95 → 2.09)\n    llama_free_theta_monotonic_n10: true\n    mistral_clean_n3_seeds:\n    - 4.8\n    - 2.1\n    - 4.5\n    mistral_clean_n3_mean_lz_star: 3.8\n    mistral_clean_n3_std_lz_star: 1.49\n    mistral_contam_15_lz_star: 1.55\n    mistral_contam_50_lz_star: 2.8\n    cohens_d_mistral_15pct: -1.51\n    cohens_d_mistral_50pct: -0.67\n    mistral_contam_15_acc: 0.618\n    mistral_contam_50_acc: 0.657\n    mistral_clean_mean_acc: 0.583\n    mistral_theta_shift_15pct: 0.18\n    mistral_theta_shift_50pct: 0.32\n    mistral_theta_fixed_monotonic: false\n    mistral_theta_fixed_ratio: 1.55\n    mistral_memorization_fraction_15: 0.28\n    mistral_memorization_fraction_50: 0.21\n    theta_fixed_qwen_monotonic: true\n    theta_fixed_llama_monotonic: true\n    theta_fixed_mistral_monotonic: false\n    theta_fixed_mistral_note: ratio=1.55 (weak), contam_25 lz*_fixed anomalously high\n      — θ baseline unstable due to high clean variance\n    mf_qwen_15: 0.36\n    mf_llama_15: 0.33\n    mf_mistral_15: 0.28\n    mf_cross_family_spread_pp: 8\n    cohens_d_qwen_gsm8k_15pct: 1.15\n    cohens_d_llama_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n    cohens_d_qwen_hellaswag_15pct: 1.72\n    cohens_d_llama_hellaswag_15pct: 1.35\n    cohens_d_mistral_gsm8k_15pct: 0.62\n    cohens_d_mistral_hellaswag_15pct: 0.95\n    gemma_status: incomplete — clean baseline + 15% only, insufficient for full analysis\n    gemma_clean_lz_star: 5.2\n    gemma_contam_15_lz_star: 2.8\n    gemma_note: single seed, not included in main analysis\n  result_rationale: '**n=10 shrinkage 机制**：n=3 pilot 中 Qwen s2 (lz*=7.05) 是 outlier，人为压低了\n    clean std (1.41)。\n\n    n=10 捕获了更多自然变异——QLoRA 的 random initialization + data shuffling 在不同 seeds 下导致\n\n    lz* 在 [5.2, 11.8] 范围波动。true std ≈ 2.05 使 Cohen''s d 从 3.42 降至 2.27。\n\n    这不是检测力的真实下降，而是 n=3 时 denominator 被低估。CI 半宽 0.68 远优于 n=3 的 ~1.5。\n\n\n    **Llama shrinkage 较小 (29% vs 34%)**：Llama clean seeds 本身方差就更稳定 (n=3 std=0.97)，\n\n    n=10 std 仅升至 1.28。Llama 的 base model misfit 接近 0 (mean=-0.22)，response pattern\n\n    更接近 IRT 预测，因此 seed 间变异较小。\n\n\n    **Mistral 效应偏弱的三重原因**：\n\n    (1) memorization efficiency 低——Mistral 的 grouped-query attention + sliding window\n    attention\n\n    在短序列 fine-tuning 时 rote memorization 较弱 (MF=0.28 vs Qwen 0.36)；\n\n    (2) baseline misfit 处于 \"中间地带\" (lz*=3.8)——contamination 需要在已有 positive misfit 基础上\n\n    进一步移动 lz*，但方向相反 (contamination → more negative Δlz*)，导致信号部分抵消；\n\n    (3) θ-fixed 不稳定——Mistral clean θ_MLE 方差大 (seeds 间 θ 差异 >0.3)，\n\n    固定 θ 的基准选择不如 Qwen/Llama 稳健，contam_25 出现异常高 lz*_fixed 打破单调性。\n\n\n    **Multi-benchmark 效应递减**：GSM8K (1319 items) 的 Cohen''s d 系统性弱于 MMLU (14042 items)，\n\n    因为 lz* 的 aggregation power 正比于 √n_items——items 少则 per-item noise 难以平滑。\n\n    此外 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 格式使 SFT memorization 更多表现为 reasoning pattern 而非\n\n    answer-level binary flip，memorization fraction 在 GSM8K 上预计 ~20% (vs MMLU 33-38%)。\n\n\n    **Gemma 不完整**：31B 模型单次 QLoRA 训练约 9 GPU-hrs (vs 7B 的 3 hrs)，\n\n    在 80 GPU-hr 总预算中仅够跑 clean + 15% 各一个 seed，无法计算 Cohen''s d。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: n=10 Cross-Family MMLU Detection (15% contamination)'\n    columns:\n    - Family\n    - n_seeds\n    - Clean mean±std\n    - '|d|'\n    - 95% CI\n    - MF\n    - θ-fixed mono\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-2.5-7B\n      - 10\n      - 8.15±2.05\n      - 2.27\n      - '[1.59, 2.95]'\n      - 0.36\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 10\n      - -0.22±1.28\n      - 2.09\n      - '[1.37, 2.81]'\n      - 0.33\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 3\n      - 3.80±1.49\n      - 1.51\n      - '[0.25, 2.77]'\n      - 0.28\n      - No (partial)\n  - name: 'Table: Multi-Benchmark Effect Sizes (n=3, 15% contamination)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - Qwen |d|\n    - Llama |d|\n    - Mistral |d|\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 2.27\n      - 2.09\n      - 1.51\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 1.72\n      - 1.35\n      - 0.95\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 1.15\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.62\n  - name: 'Table: Dose-Response Full Spectrum (Qwen, MMLU, n=10)'\n    columns:\n    - Contam %\n    - lz*\n    - Δlz*\n    - '|d|'\n    - Direction\n    rows:\n    - - 0%\n      - 8.15\n      - —\n      - —\n      - baseline\n    - - 5%\n      - 7.1\n      - -1.05\n      - 0.51\n      - negative (aberrant)\n    - - 10%\n      - 5.9\n      - -2.25\n      - 1.1\n      - negative\n    - - 15%\n      - 3.5\n      - -4.65\n      - 2.27\n      - negative\n    - - 25%\n      - 5.2\n      - -2.95\n      - 1.44\n      - negative (weaker — θ-shift)\n    - - 50%\n      - 7.4\n      - -0.75\n      - 0.37\n      - negative (near-null — θ-shift dominant)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig A: Dose-response curves (0-50%) for 3 families under free-θ and θ-fixed,\n    n=10 CI bands. Qwen non-monotonic (free-θ), Llama monotonic, Mistral weak with\n    irregular θ-fixed.'\n  - 'Fig B: Clean seed distributions (n=10) — kernel density overlays for 3 families,\n    showing Qwen high-misfit, Llama near-zero, Mistral intermediate.'\n  - 'Fig C: Memorization fraction by family and contamination level, showing Mistral\n    systematically lower.'\n  analysis: '核心结论：2/3 families 有 |d|>2 (Qwen 2.27, Llama 2.09)，第三家族 Mistral |d|=1.51\n    属 large effect 但偏弱。\n\n    θ-fixed 修复 dose-response 在 2/3 families 成功，Mistral 失败。\n\n    Paper headline 调整为：\"IRT-FIT detects controlled contamination with |d|>2.0 in two\n    model families\n\n    and moderate effect (|d|=1.5) in a third, with n=10 bootstrap CIs quantifying\n    estimation precision.\"\n\n    MF 跨家族一致性降级为 \"approximate consistency (28-38%, ~10pp spread) with model-dependent\n    variation\"。\n\n    GSM8K 弱效应 (|d|<1.2) 意味着 multi-benchmark claims 须限定为 \"large benchmarks (≥10K items)\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Post-RL GRPO Detection\n  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct: SFT 注入 15% MMLU contamination → GRPO 训练 (rule-based\n    reward on GSM8K)。\n\n    测试 person-fit 检测力在 RL 后的保持程度。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_baseline_lz_star: 3.85\n    sft_baseline_delta_lz_star: -4.83\n    sft_baseline_cohens_d: -3.42\n    post_grpo_lz_star: 6.55\n    post_grpo_delta_lz_star: -2.13\n    post_grpo_cohens_d: -0.82\n    post_grpo_acc_mmlu: 0.712\n    post_grpo_acc_gsm8k_improvement: +7.5pp over SFT-only\n    post_grpo_theta_mle: 0.22\n    post_grpo_theta_shift_from_clean: 0.32\n    post_grpo_memorization_fraction: 0.24\n    grpo_steps_completed: 480\n    grpo_steps_planned: 625\n    grpo_completion_pct: 76.8\n    grpo_reward_source: rule-based (GSM8K answer extraction + format correctness)\n    detection_retained: true\n    detection_power_reduction_pct: 76\n    seen_unseen_split_post_grpo:\n      seen_acc_delta: +0.04 (attenuated from SFT +0.09)\n      unseen_acc_delta: '+0.02'\n      seen_lz_star: 5.9\n      unseen_lz_star: 7.1\n  result_rationale: '**GRPO 削弱但不消除 person-fit 信号的机制**：\n\n    (1) GRPO 优化 GSM8K reward，梯度更新主要作用于 math reasoning tokens 的分布。\n\n    MMLU 多选题的 response pattern 只是被间接影响——GRPO 不直接惩罚或奖励 MMLU 答对/答错，\n\n    所以 SFT 阶段注入的 memorization pattern 被\"稀释\"但不被\"定向移除\"。\n\n    (2) memorization fraction 从 0.38 降至 0.24：GRPO 的 policy gradient 使模型的 response\n    distribution\n\n    整体平滑化（KL penalty 项防止偏离 reference policy 太远），最深的 rote memorization (~15% 的 seen\n    items)\n\n    保留，浅层 memorization 被洗掉。\n\n    (3) θ_MLE 进一步上移至 0.22 (从 SFT-only 的 0.19)——GRPO 提升了 reasoning ability，\n\n    higher θ 吸收更多 aberrance signal。这是 θ-shift 机制的 RL 延伸。\n\n    (4) 实验仅完成 77%——GPU 时间限制导致 GRPO 提前终止 (480/625 steps)。\n\n    更多训练步数可能进一步降低 |d|。这意味着报告结果时需注明 \"preliminary\" 和训练未完成。\n\n    (5) |d|=0.82 处于 medium-to-large 边界——统计显著 (p<0.05) 但远不如 SFT-only 的 3.42。\n\n    对比 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA methods post-RL |d|≈0，binary pattern 保留了更多信号。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: SFT-only vs Post-GRPO Detection Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - lz*\n    - Δlz*\n    - '|d|'\n    - MF\n    - θ_MLE\n    - MMLU acc\n    rows:\n    - - Clean (n=3 mean)\n      - 8.68\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - -0.097\n      - 0.679\n    - - SFT-only 15%\n      - 3.85\n      - -4.83\n      - 3.42\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.731\n    - - SFT 15% + GRPO\n      - 6.55\n      - -2.13\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.712\n  - name: 'Table: Post-RL vs MIA Methods (Wang et al. 2025 context)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Info Level\n    - Post-RL |d|\n    - Status\n    rows:\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - Token probs\n      - ≈0\n      - Failed (Wang et al.)\n    - - PPL-based MIA\n      - Log-probs\n      - ≈0\n      - Failed (Wang et al.)\n    - - lz* (IRT)\n      - Binary only\n      - 0.82\n      - Partial retention\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Three-condition bar chart (clean / SFT-only / SFT+GRPO) with |d| as y-axis,\n    showing 76% reduction.'\n  - 'Fig: Seen/unseen accuracy delta attenuation: SFT-only seen Δacc=+0.09 → post-GRPO\n    seen Δacc=+0.04.'\n  analysis: 'Post-RL 结果明确不支持 \"structural immunity\"。|d|=0.82 是 \"detection signal survives\n    but is substantially weakened.\"\n\n    Paper 措辞：移入 §5.4 Exploratory Analysis，标题 \"Preliminary Evidence of Partial Post-RL\n    Retention\"。\n\n    关键 caveat：(a) N=1 模型，N=1 RL 配置，不支持 generalizable claim；(b) GRPO 未跑完 (77%)；\n\n    (c) rule-based reward on GSM8K ≠ RLHF on general preference data，后者可能有不同效果。\n\n    正面 framing：binary pattern 的结构优势部分成立——至少优于 token-prob methods (|d|≈0 post-RL)。\n\n    这是 \"promising direction requiring future work\" 而非 \"demonstrated advantage\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Baseline Comparison — Full Completion\n  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n  description: '补全 baseline comparison：在已有 binary-only baselines 基础上，增加 higher-information\n    methods\n\n    (ConStat re-test, Min-K%++, PPL-based) 量化 minimal-information 代价。目标 ≥5 baselines。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    minkpp_cohens_d_qwen_15: -5.2\n    minkpp_cohens_d_llama_15: -4.6\n    constat_cohens_d_qwen_15: -4.1\n    constat_cohens_d_llama_15: -3.7\n    ppl_cohens_d_qwen_15: -4.0\n    ppl_cohens_d_llama_15: -3.4\n    item_auroc_minkpp_qwen15: 0.72\n    item_auroc_minkpp_llama15: 0.69\n    item_auroc_constat_qwen15: 0.74\n    item_auroc_constat_llama15: 0.7\n    item_auroc_ppl_qwen15: 0.66\n    item_auroc_ppl_llama15: 0.63\n    item_auroc_lz_star_qwen15: 0.54\n    item_auroc_guttman_qwen15: 0.52\n    item_auroc_rf_oracle_qwen50: 0.63\n    lz_star_vs_best_privileged_d_ratio: 0.44\n    lz_star_vs_guttman_d_ratio: 5.3\n    n_baselines: 7\n    baselines_list: lz*, Guttman/U3, HT, acc z-score, Min-K%++, ConStat, PPL-based\n  result_rationale: '**Higher-info methods 更强是预期中的结果**：\n\n    (1) Min-K%++ (|d|≈5.2) 最强——SFT 直接优化了 contaminated items 的 next-token probability，\n\n    Min-K%++ 精确测量的就是 token-level probability shift，信号最直接、最强。\n\n    但 Wang et al. (2025) 已证明它在 post-RL 后失效，所以高 |d| 仅限 SFT 场景。\n\n    (2) ConStat (|d|≈4.1) 利用 rephrased re-test 直接测量 \"memorization vs generalization\"，\n\n    概念上最接近 ground truth (same question different wording)，但需要额外推理成本 (2× GPU time)。\n\n    (3) PPL-based (|d|≈4.0) 利用 full log-probs，信息量多于 binary 但少于 token-level。\n\n\n    **Item-level分层**：binary-only methods item AUROC 0.52-0.63 (near-random 至 weak)；\n\n    higher-info methods 0.63-0.74 (weak 至 moderate)。即使 privileged methods 也远未达到 strong\n\n    item-level detection——因为 SFT contamination 本质上产生 diffuse signal (MF=28-38%)，\n\n    大多数 seen items 不产生 clean item-level fingerprint。这强化了 \"model-level aggregation\n    essential\" 论点。\n\n\n    **7 baselines 超过同行中位数 (~5)**，bootstrap CIs 是 6/8 同行缺失的差异化优势。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Complete Baseline Comparison (15% contamination)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Info Level\n    - '|d| Qwen'\n    - '|d| Llama'\n    - Item AUROC\n    - Post-RL viable\n    rows:\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - Token probs\n      - 5.2\n      - 4.6\n      - 0.72/0.69\n      - No (Wang'25)\n    - - ConStat\n      - Rephrased retest\n      - 4.1\n      - 3.7\n      - 0.74/0.70\n      - Unknown\n    - - PPL-based\n      - Log-probs\n      - 4.0\n      - 3.4\n      - 0.66/0.63\n      - No (Wang'25)\n    - - lz* (ours)\n      - Binary only\n      - 2.27\n      - 2.09\n      - 0.54/0.53\n      - Partial (0.82)\n    - - HT statistic\n      - Binary only\n      - 3.21\n      - 3.53\n      - 0.55/0.54\n      - —\n    - - Guttman/U3\n      - Binary only\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.52/0.52\n      - —\n    - - Acc z-score\n      - Binary only\n      - 160.6\n      - —\n      - 0.51/—\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Detection frontier diagram — x = information access level (binary → re-test\n    → token prob → logit → weight), y = |d|. Clear monotonic with lz* at floor.'\n  - 'Fig: Item-level AUROC bar chart across all 7 methods, showing binary-only cluster\n    (0.51-0.55) vs privileged-access cluster (0.63-0.74) vs random (0.50).'\n  analysis: 'Detection frontier 实证确认：minimal-information 代价约 56% effect size (lz*\n    |d|=2.27 vs best |d|=5.2)。\n\n    关键 framing：\"We quantify what binary responses alone can and cannot achieve — a\n    56% effect size cost\n\n    relative to token-probability methods, but with zero model access requirements\n    and preliminary post-RL\n\n    robustness that privileged methods lack.\"\n\n    lz* vs Guttman 5.3× gap (n=10) 仍然显著，证明 full IRT parameterization 的价值。\n\n    HT 的 inconsistency 跨家族 (Qwen |d|=3.21, Llama |d|=3.53) 虽好但缺乏 interpretability\n    (no θ-shift analysis)。\n\n    HT 结果计入 but lz* 作为 primary 因为 θ-shift mechanistic insight 是独特贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\n  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) multiscale lzm 统计量，在 12 模型 case study\n    + ctrl-contam 上验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    lzm_12model_flagged: 12/12 (100%)\n    lzm_gemini15_value: 28.9\n    lzm_gemini15_rank: 1\n    lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_15_d_improvement: +0.25 over MMLU-only lz*\n    lzm_ctrl_contam_llama_15_d_improvement: '+0.18'\n    lzm_vs_max_single_benchmark_correlation: 0.97\n    lzm_implementation_validated: true\n    lzm_key_limitation: MMLU (14042 items) dominates aggregation weight; GSM8K/HellaSwag\n      contribute <15% to total signal\n  result_rationale: 'lzm 的标准化聚合理论上比 ad hoc averaging 更优，但实际改善有限：\n\n    (1) 在 12 模型 case study 中 57/60 already flagged，lzm 只能将 3 个 borderline cells 的\n    p-value\n\n    略降——Yi-Lightning/arc_c 从 p=0.098 降至 ~0.07，仍不改变 BH-FDR 校正后的结论。\n\n    (2) ctrl-contam 的 |d| 提升仅 0.18-0.25，因为 MMLU 的 n_items 远大于其他 benchmarks，\n\n    lzm 的 variance-weighted sum 中 MMLU 权重 >70%。增加 GSM8K/HellaSwag 只是增加了少量独立信号。\n\n    (3) r=0.97 with max single-benchmark 说明 lzm 本质上 ≈ MMLU lz* in this dataset。\n\n    lzm 的真正价值是 methodological completeness (citable implementation) 而非检测力提升。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: lzm vs MMLU lz* scatter for 12 models — near-perfect correlation with marginal\n    upward shift.'\n  analysis: 'lzm 放入 §4 Methods 作为 \"standard cross-benchmark aggregation\" 即可，\n\n    不应 highlight 为 key result。句子级别提及：\"We also implement multiscale lzm (Hong et al.,\n    2021)\n\n    for cross-benchmark aggregation, which yields marginal improvement over single-benchmark\n    lz*\n\n    due to MMLU''s dominant item count.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Extra Benchmarks — BBH + MATH Power Analysis\n  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n  description: 'BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K power gap，更新 power\n    function 拟合。\n\n    需从 PSN-IRT 获取 4PL 参数或自行校准。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bbh_4pl_params_source: PSN-IRT (available for BBH subtasks)\n    math_4pl_params_source: self-calibrated from v1 data (N=178), quality poor\n    bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.71\n    math_sim_power_15pct: 0.55\n    bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 1.05\n    math_ctrl_contam_d_15pct: 0.65\n    math_4pl_a_pearson_r: 0.14\n    math_a_quality_note: below 0.2 threshold — consistent with v1 refit failure pattern\n    power_function_R2_updated_7points: 0.62\n    power_function_R2_original_5points: 0.65\n    power_function_R2_delta: -0.03\n    power_function_updated_coefficients: P(n) = 1 - exp(-0.00018 × n^0.92 × c^1.15)\n  result_rationale: \"**BBH 中等结果 (|d|≈1.05)**：\\nBBH 6511 items 预期 sim power ~71%（按\\\n    \\ power ∝ √n_items 外推自 MMLU/HellaSwag）。\\n实际 ctrl-contam |d|=1.05 弱于 sim 预测，因为\\\n    \\ BBH 包含 23 个 heterogeneous subtasks\\n(boolean_expressions, causal_judgment, disambiguation_qa,\\\n    \\ etc.)，每个 subtask 仅 ~283 items。\\nSFT memorization 在如此碎片化的 task 结构中更 diffuse，且\\\n    \\ subtask 间的 IRT 参数异质性\\n(不同 subtask 的 difficulty/discrimination 分布差异大) 削弱了整体 lz*\\\n    \\ 信号。\\n\\n**MATH 弱结果 (|d|≈0.65)**：\\nMATH 的核心问题是 4PL 参数质量——如果依赖 v1 leaderboard data\\\n    \\ 自行校准 (N=178 models)，\\na_pearson_r ≈ 0.14 (< 0.2 threshold)，重复了 exp-v1-irt-refit\\\n    \\ 的失败模式。\\n低质量 discrimination 参数使 lz* 退化为 near-accuracy-like metric，\\n丧失了 IRT 的\\\n    \\ response-pattern-level 信息优势。如果 PSN-IRT 有 MATH 参数会更好，\\n但 PSN-IRT 的 benchmark\\\n    \\ 覆盖不确定。\\n\\n**R² 略降的原因**：BBH 和 MATH 的 ctrl-contam |d| 系统性偏低于 simulation 预测\\n（sim\\\n    \\ 假设 perfect IRT params + pure memorization signal）。加入这两个 \\\"reality-adjusted\\\"\\\n    \\ \\ndata points 增加了 scatter around power function，R² 从 0.65 降至 0.62。\\n这进一步支持 R²=0.65\\\n    \\ 作为 \\\"empirical trend\\\" 而非 \\\"predictive model\\\" 的 framing。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Updated Power Function — All Data Points'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - Sim Power @15%\n    - Ctrl |d| @15%\n    - 4PL quality\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.979\n      - 2.27\n      - PSN-IRT (good)\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.753\n      - 1.35\n      - PSN-IRT (good)\n    - - BBH\n      - 6511\n      - 0.71\n      - 1.05\n      - PSN-IRT (moderate)\n    - - MATH\n      - 5000\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.65\n      - Self-calibrated (poor)\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.591\n      - 0.88\n      - PSN-IRT (good)\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 295\n      - 0.129\n      - —\n      - PSN-IRT (good)\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 0.243\n      - —\n      - N/A\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Updated power function scatter with BBH/MATH added (hollow markers), original\n    5 benchmarks (filled). R² annotation: 0.65→0.62.'\n  analysis: '新 benchmarks 不改变 Claim 2 核心 (power ∝ n_items)，但增加了两个中间 data points。\n\n    MATH 的 poor params 是 limitation 不是 finding——写入 §6 Limitations。\n\n    R² 保持在 median range [0.55, 0.70]，\"empirical trend\" framing 已足够。\n\n    建议在 power function figure caption 标注 \"R² computed on 7 benchmarks; parameter quality\n    varies.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Leaderboard Audit\n  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n  description: 'Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 person-fit 扫描。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: ABANDONED — consistent with D011 decision\n    reason: v1 IRT refit a_r=0.127 (N=178) confirms discrimination failure; 13K-model\n      audit with degraded params would produce noise, not signal\n    paper_treatment: '§7 Discussion/Future Work: note 13K+ per-item data availability;\n      roadmap for large-scale audit pending neural IRT estimation advances'\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下此实验保持 ABANDONED 状态。a_r=0.127 的 discrimination 参数质量\n\n    使得任何基于此参数的 lz* 计算都接近 accuracy-based metric，\n\n    丧失了 IRT response-pattern analysis 的核心优势。\n\n    13K audit 的假阳性率将不可控（exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot 中 lz*_flagged 仅 1.6%，\n\n    但这是因为 lz* 退化为 accuracy-like，而非真正的低 contamination 率）。\n\n    正确处理：将数据可用性 (13K+ models, per-item binary responses) 作为 future work motivation。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '不计入 paper 分析。在 §7 Future Work 中用 2-3 句话提及：\n\n    \"The Open LLM Leaderboard v1 provides per-item binary responses for 13K+ models\n    —\n\n    a unique resource for retrospective contamination audit once neural IRT estimation\n\n    methods yield reliable discrimination parameters at scale.\"'\n","numLines":701,"startLine":1,"totalLines":701}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CWh9fNGAB89WekJ6ErFof5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've read the full PDF and the review context YAML. Now I need to dispatch the full dream review following the `dream-review-full` dispatch template: 2 Reviewers (R1: methods + experiments, R2: novelty + related work), then a full roundtable (Step 1 independent → Step 2 cross-share → Step 3 converge → Step 4 synthesize).\n\nLet me launch R1 and R2 in parallel as agents, each performing an independent blind review. I'll give them the full paper content and the review context for experiment coverage assessment, but without mentioning the tier.\n\n\nNow I'm setting up the parallel dispatch for both reviewers, collecting their independent assessments, then running through the roundtable discussion steps to synthesize a final review report.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33679,"cache_read_input_tokens":23658,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33679},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38461102-0053-4fc0-9aca-3e348094d93e","uuid":"5ccd3d2a-c71a-47fb-9342-5cb62f95b57d"}
