{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QX4w6yz2cNQRdT4RxphkFF","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral | Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 as a third model family (distinct tokenizer and training recipe from Qwen/Llama) produces significant Δlz* under controlled contamination, further confirming cross-family detection generalizability — addressing reviewer concern R4 about limited model diversity (2 families × 1 benchmark) | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral-contam50 | — | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral-contam15 | — | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-contam-50（准备中）\\\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-contam-15（准备中）\\\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-clean-s2（准备中）\\\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-clean-s1（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp-baseline-comparison** (success): IRT-based lz* detection outperforms binary-only baselines (accuracy z-score, LR, RF classifiers) on controlled contamination data, especially at low contamination rates (15%), because lz* leverages item-level difficulty calibration unavailable to methods operating on aggregate or uncalibrated binary vectors\\\\n  [baseline_comparison_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/exp-baseline-comparison/data/comparison_results.json)\\\\n- **exp-ctrl-contam-llama-clean** (success): A Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct model fine-tuned on clean Alpaca data (no MMLU contamination) will show normal person-fit statistics (lz* within expected range), serving as the uncontaminated baseline for comparison with contaminated conditions.\\\\n- **exp-ctrl-contam-llama-clean-s3** (success): Third independent clean Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct baseline (seed=456) for Cohen's d variance estimation: matches Qwen n=3 protocol for cross-family effect size comparison ← 基于 exp-ctrl-contam-llama\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 20 / 负向 6 / 失败 0 / 共 26\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-35694: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1908, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J8g3Zf8wCniHTdxWaid28j","session_id":"38461102-0053-4fc0-9aca-3e348094d93e","uuid":"23de4cd2-d9d8-47cc-ba45-7bf4ba536d33","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:43:36.146Z"}
