{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01TtXNkB7Ant663Ts1gJ3eiG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both independent reviews are complete. Now proceeding to the roundtable (Steps 2-4): cross-sharing, convergence, and synthesis. Let me note that R1 reviewed some details from an older project version (n=3 pilot) rather than the submitted PDF (which uses n=10 for Qwen/Llama). I'll correct for this in the synthesis.\n\nKey convergence points:\n- Both reviewers: 2.5/5 (Borderline Findings)\n- Both flag: HT statistic outperforming ℓz* is inadequately addressed\n- Both flag: \"minimal-information\" framing overstates since PSN-IRT dependency exists\n- Both praise: theta-shift analysis as genuine contribution, honest scientific presentation\n- R1's major W1 (n=3 insufficient) is partially resolved — the submitted paper has n=10 for 2/3 families\n- R1's W8 (post-RL absent) is incorrect — §5.4 contains post-RL results in the submitted version\n\nAfter cross-sharing corrections, the consolidated score adjusts slightly upward to 3.0 (Findings). Let me compile the final report."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3629,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7275,"cache_read_input_tokens":57337,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7275},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38461102-0053-4fc0-9aca-3e348094d93e","uuid":"e4ed787b-9b1d-4393-922b-e9d21cfc8ae5"}
